sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor M as Administrator
  participant AD as Admin dashboard
  participant AU as Firebase Auth
  participant CF as adminManageUser (callable)
  participant FS as Cloud Firestore
  actor U as Suspended user
  M->>AD: Suspend an account and give a reason
  AD->>M: Ask for the admin password again
  M->>AD: Password
  AD->>AU: Re-authenticate
  AU-->>AD: Fresh token
  AD->>CF: suspend (uid, reason)
  CF->>CF: Check role=admin claim, recent sign-in, not own account, not deleted
  CF->>AU: Set the suspended custom claim
  CF->>FS: users.status suspended with the reason, open offers withdrawn
  CF->>FS: Write adminLog entry
  CF-->>AD: ok
  U->>AU: Next token refresh carries suspended=true
  Note over U,FS: Security rules allow only the user's own profile and the support chat
